        Token->>AzureCLI: Request access token

        alt Authentication fails
            AzureCLI-->>Token: Authentication error
            Token-->>Orchestrator: Token acquisition failure
            Orchestrator-->>Main: Authentication error
            Main-->>Preload: Return sanitized failure
            Preload-->>App: Reject request
            App-->>User: Request Azure CLI sign-in
        else Authentication succeeds
            AzureCLI-->>Token: Access token
            Token-->>Orchestrator: Token

            par Retrieve MSX data
                Orchestrator->>MSX: Query live account data
                MSX->>MSXAPI: Send authenticated request
                MSXAPI-->>MSX: Opportunities and milestones
                MSX-->>Orchestrator: Normalized MSX records
            and Retrieve SharePoint context
                Orchestrator->>SharePoint: Query supporting content
                SharePoint->>SPAPI: Send authenticated request
                SPAPI-->>SharePoint: Documents and metadata
                SharePoint-->>Orchestrator: Normalized context
            end

            Orchestrator->>Coach: Analyze consolidated context
            Coach->>Contracts: Construct contract-compliant result
            Contracts-->>Coach: Validated result
            Coach-->>Orchestrator: Coaching recommendations

            Orchestrator-->>Main: Platform response
            Main-->>Preload: Return IPC response
            Preload-->>App: Deliver result
            App-->>User: Render account intelligence
        end
    end